-- 모젤-자르-루버, 포르토 and 포르투 에 도우루) and names left in Latin
-- letters. A place now sits inside the place above it and has one row: the
-- rows are the dictionary's projection, rendered by
-- tools/catalog/enrichment/materialize_catalog_terms.py.
--
-- A bottle, and a term a member saved, that named a row that went takes the
-- row the place keeps, so the rows that went can be deleted.

